config BR2_PACKAGE_FIGLET
	bool "figlet"
	help
	  FIGlet renders text as large ASCII-art letters made out of
	  ordinary characters.

	  Buildroot has no figlet package of its own, and openHC has only
	  ever run the build host's copy (see build/Dockerfile). This
	  packages it for the target so the banner can be generated on the
	  device instead of frozen into the image at build time.

	  Only the slant and standard fonts are installed — the full font
	  set is ~700K, which is not worth carrying for a boot splash.

	  http://www.figlet.org/
